#ASSERT `Has my complaint been dealt with in time` (`d` 31 1 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 1 1 2000) TRUE (`d` 3 3 2026) (`d` 10 3 2026) EQUALS `IRO late`
#ASSERT `Has my complaint been dealt with in time` (`d` 31 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 3 2026) (`d` 30 3 2026) TRUE (`d` 30 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS `IRO in time`
#ASSERT `Has my complaint been dealt with in time` (`d` 31 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 3 2026) (`d` 30 3 2026) TRUE (`d` 31 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS `IRO late`
#ASSERT `Has my complaint been dealt with in time` (`d` 31 1 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 1 1 2000) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 2 3 2026) EQUALS `IRO pending`
#ASSERT `Has my complaint been dealt with in time` (`d` 31 1 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 1 1 2000) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 3 3 2026) EQUALS `IRO late`
#ASSERT `Has my complaint been dealt with in time` (`d` 31 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 3 2026) (`d` 30 3 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 3 3 2026) EQUALS `IRO pending`

